{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When navigating a dungeon, a map is always a handy tool. But what if the dungeon <strong>IS</strong> the map? In this lighthearted puzzle game, you'll fold the map in various ways to find new rooms and uncover paths to rooms that initially look inaccessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fold and unfold, find loot, and unlock doors to make your way to the chest containing (hopefully!) the legendary GaMuffin!  After all, map solving is hungry work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innovative Map-Folding Mechanics:</strong> Alter the landscape by folding the map to solve puzzles and navigate obstacles.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Engage with a variety of puzzles that test your creativity and strategic thinking.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Captivating Visuals:</strong> Enjoy a beautifully crafted 2D world with a unique art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's make the world a little bit better:\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/Nerdfighteria_logo.png?t=1745428889\" />\u00a0 10% of all profits will go to the Project for Awesome and the Foundation to Decrease World Suck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rock walls will block your progress:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/rock_walls_75.png?t=1745428889\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other barriers can be removed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/barriers_75.png?t=1745428889\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You just need the right &quot;key&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/keys_75.png?t=1745428889\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even a rock wall isn't an impossible barrier when you can control the map itself:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/fold_example.gif?t=1745428889\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532990?t=1745428889","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532990?t=1745428889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/f440b702f2f9d7a7263a9146dedf81364aa577b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745428889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/f440b702f2f9d7a7263a9146dedf81364aa577b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745428889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3545410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When navigating a dungeon, a map is always a handy tool. But what if the dungeon <strong>IS</strong> the map? In this lighthearted puzzle game, you'll fold the map in various ways to find new rooms and uncover paths to rooms that initially look inaccessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fold and unfold, find loot, and unlock doors to make your way to the chest containing (hopefully!) the legendary GaMuffin!  After all, map solving is hungry work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innovative Map-Folding Mechanics:</strong> Alter the landscape by folding the map to solve puzzles and navigate obstacles.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Engage with a variety of puzzles that test your creativity and strategic thinking.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Captivating Visuals:</strong> Enjoy a beautifully crafted 2D world with a unique art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's make the world a little bit better:\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/Nerdfighteria_logo.png?t=1745428889\" />\u00a0 10% of all profits will go to the Project for Awesome and the Foundation to Decrease World Suck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rock walls will block your progress:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/rock_walls_75.png?t=1745428889\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other barriers can be removed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/barriers_75.png?t=1745428889\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You just need the right &quot;key&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/keys_75.png?t=1745428889\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even a rock wall isn't an impossible barrier when you can control the map itself:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/fold_example.gif?t=1745428889\" /></p>","developers":["Muffin Man Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/header.jpg?t=1745428889","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":